# (full write-up: .docs/audits/2026-09-28-d3d11-contract-audit/area-05-context-state.md)
# MATCH: fresh defaults; every in-range per-stage CB/SRV/sampler/shader round
#   trip with AddRef (x86: all; x64: all but CS); CS UAVs; IA layout, VB slots
#   0-7, IB (format/offset kept with NULL buffer, invalid formats stored),
#   topology stored raw; RS state, viewport/scissor counts <= 16; blend state +
#   factor (NULL -> 1,1,1,1) + mask; OMGetRenderTargets; basic
#   OMSetRenderTargetsAndUnorderedAccessViews; UAV initial counts (CS and OM);
#   SRV-refused-while-output-bound on VS..PS; mip granularity; SO round trip;
#   predication; ClearState (except CB1 NumConstants); Set1/Get1 windows.
# DIFFER (Vitreo wrong):
#   deferred GetType 0 (want 1); Get*ConstantBuffers1 NumConstants 0 for a
#   whole-buffer/unbound slot (want 4096); binding adds a public reference
#   (want +0, Release-after-bind 0); x64 ID3D11ComputeShader IUnknown methods
#   and ID3D11CommandList slots 4-7 dispatch to the wrong interface (vtable
#   overlap); IA VB slots 8-31 dropped; RSSetViewports/ScissorRects(17) clamped
#   (want dropped); StencilRef not masked to 0xFF; duplicate RTVs / RTV-DSV
#   size mismatch not dropped; OMSetRenderTargets does not unbind OM UAVs;
#   OMSetRenderTargetsAndUnorderedAccessViews: UAVs outside the new range kept,
#   (0,..,0,0) clears nothing, KEEP_* partial unbinds missing, invalid calls
#   (start+num>8, RTV/UAV conflict, duplicate UAV) not dropped, UAVStartSlot <
#   NumRTVs binds both; OM<->CS UAV and RTV<->CS UAV mutual unbind missing;
#   HS/DS/GS SRVs not unbound by RTV/UAV/DSV binds (CS too for DSV); CS SRV not
#   refused while DSV bound; UAV hazards ignore array slices; RTV of a 3D W
#   slice does not unbind the volume SRV; no buffer hazards (UAV/SO vs VB, IB,
#   SRV); duplicate SO targets not dropped; Set*ConstantBuffers1 invalid
#   windows (first/num not x16, num > 4096, one NULL array) not dropped;
#   CreateInputLayout never checks the VS signature (missing/renamed/duplicate
#   semantic), per-vertex step rate, alignment, NULL+0 elements, bytecode.
# UNDEFINED on Windows (not judged): out-of-range StartSlot/NumX (CB lands in a
